        "title": "Save it where you found it.",
        "paragraphs": [
          "A button in your browser for the web, the share sheet on your phone. Three seconds, and you are back to what you were doing.",
          "What you already have comes along too. Your bookmarks and saved posts import in one go, so you are not starting from an empty shelf."
        ],
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "You find a gem",
            "body": "Halfway down a feed, in a message, or an idea that turns up on the walk home.",
            "visual": "feed-marquee"
          },
          {
            "title": "One tap to save",
            "body": "The browser button, or Shelf in the share sheet.",
            "visual": "tap-pulse"
          },
          {
            "title": "One line about why",
            "body": "Written while it is still in your head. That line is what finds it back.",
